        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Misadventures of Merlin Jones, In Search of the Castaways\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney\n- People: Tommy Kirk, Annette Funicello, Hayley Mills, Maurice Chevalier, Robert Stevenson, Lowell S. Hawley, Jules Verne\n- Concepts: Captain Grant's Children\n\nFacts:\n- Jules Verne wrote the 1868 adventure novel \"Captain Grant's Children.\"\n- In Search of the Castaways is a 1962 Walt Disney Productions feature film about a worldwide search for a shipwrecked sea captain.\n- In Search of the Castaways stars Hayley Mills and Maurice Chevalier.\n- Robert Stevenson directed In Search of the Castaways from a screenplay by Lowell S. Hawley.\n- The screenplay for In Search of the Castaways was based on Jules Verne's 1868 novel \"Captain Grant's Children.\"\n- The Misadventures of Merlin Jones is a 1964 Walt Disney production starring Tommy Kirk and Annette Funicello.",
